A faded olive work jacket over a cream knit vest and a white collared shirt, dark grey wool trousers, scuffed brown leather shoes.
A yellow raincoat over a navy school uniform, white knee socks and red rain boots.
Low dusk sun from screen left, the persimmon-tree side, is the only key; the shelter's single fluorescent tube is off.
A worn brown leather doctor's bag with a brass clasp, about 40 cm wide, hanging heavy from its handles.
